{"4761080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DIE as HEROES", "steam_appid": 4761080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Die as Heroes</i></strong> is a tabletop dark fantasy game inspired by games like Dungeons &amp; Dragons and other tabletop games like HeroQuest or Journeys in the Dark in a video game format. Ideal pizza night fun!<br><br>It is designed to allow you to play  solo or with friends, with a single character up to a full party of 4, or mix and match (2 players each control 2 characters, etc)<br><br><strong><i>Die as Heroes</i></strong> ships with several adventures that provide several hours of fun. However, the fun doesn't end when players complete the iniitial campaign.<br><br><strong><i>Die as Heroes</i></strong> comes with a robust editor, hooked into steamworks that allows players to create and share their own stories and adventures with the world. Feel free to create short adventures, stand alone stories or sweeping massive multi-adventure storyline campaigns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4761080/extras/f017ef9916f4802fced738d06f206888.avif?t=1787358809\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4761080/extras_big/f017ef9916f4802fced738d06f206888.webp?t=1787358809 width=1560 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4761080/extras/32e599411998d8200c7234399b37b759.poster.avif?t=1787358809\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4761080/extras/32e599411998d8200c7234399b37b759.webm?t=17873588